{
 "_doc": "LICENCE-ALLOWLIST-1104 seed (owner 2026-11-04: Deny All, option 1, policy approved). The DB table licallow_licences, created by the planned combined lists-to-DB migration 016 (draft not yet in this repository; not applied), supersedes this file once applied; until then this file is the seed and fallback. Only status 'active' rows are used; storable=true ones allow storage, other active rows are recognised link-only licences. ND, no-educational-use and fee-only are rejected by config/licence_rules.json BEFORE this list is read. Matching: vera.licence_gate.norm_id on id/aliases, norm_url on urls. New rows arrive as status 'proposed' from scripts/licence_research.py and need owner or orchestrator approval (status -> active, approved_by set) before they are used. evidence_read_state records how much of the evidence page was actually read. A row with reject=true is a recognised rejecting licence (R1 reject classes): the gate rejects it.",
